            </note>
            <note corresp="#d786-f2" n="2" xml:id="d786-f2-content">
                <p>René Massigli.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d786-f3" n="3" xml:id="d786-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d786-f4" n="4" xml:id="d786-f4-content">
                <p>i. e., Georgy Filippovich Saksin, the Acting Soviet Representative on the
                    European Advisory Commission.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
